  "details": "   * CVE-url: https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2024-2201\n     - x86/cpufeatures: Add CPUID_LNX_5 to track recently added Linux-defined word\n     - x86/bugs: Change commas to semicolons in 'spectre_v2' sysfs file\n     - x86/bhi: Add support for clearing branch history at syscall entry\n     - x86/bhi: Define SPEC_CTRL_BHI_DIS_S\n     - x86/bhi: Enumerate Branch History Injection (BHI) bug\n     - x86/bhi: Add BHI mitigation knob\n     - x86/bhi: Mitigate KVM by default\n     - x86/bugs: Fix BHI documentation\n     - x86/bugs: Cache the value of MSR_IA32_ARCH_CAPABILITIES\n     - x86/bugs: Rename various 'ia32_cap' variables to 'x86_arch_cap_msr'\n     - x86/bugs: Fix BHI handling of RRSBA\n     - x86/bugs: Clarify that syscall hardening isn't a BHI mitigation\n     - x86/bugs: Fix BHI retpoline check\n   * CVE-url: https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2024-26642\n     - netfilter: nf_tables: disallow anonymous set with timeout flag\n   * CVE-url: https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2021-33631\n     - ext4: fix kernel BUG in 'ext4_write_inline_data_end()'\n   * CVE-url: https://ubuntu.com/security/CVE-2021-47545\n     - perf hists: Properly release format fields\n     - perf hist: Fix memory leak of a perf_hpp_fmt\n   * Miscellaneous upstream changes\n     - media: xc4000: Fix atomicity violation in xc4000_get_frequency\n     - updateconfigs for CONFIG_BHI_{AUTO|OFF|ON}",
  "references": [
